B.Sy=new A.lP(7,"\ud83c\udfe5","\u0110i kh\xe1m \u1edf b\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n","Visit the Hospital","B\u1ea1n s\u1ed1t 3 ng\xe0y li\u1ec1n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ec7t r\u0169. H\xf4m nay b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ebfn ph\xf2ng kh\xe1m. C\u1eeda k\xednh t\u1ef1 m\u1edf, y t\xe1 nh\xecn b\u1ea1n v\xe0 h\u1ecfi \u0111i\u1ec1u g\xec \u0111\xf3...","Fever for 3 days, exhausted. You must visit a clinic. The door opens, a nurse looks at you and asks something...","LU\xd4N mang th\u1ebb \u5065\u4fdd\u5361 \u2014 c\xf3 th\u1ebb ch\u1ec9 tr\u1ea3 ~150-400 NTD, kh\xf4ng c\xf3 ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 g\u1ea5p 3-5 l\u1ea7n. B\u1ec7nh nh\u1eb9 n\xean \u0111\u1ebfn \u8a3a\u6240 (ph\xf2ng kh\xe1m) thay v\xec \u91ab\u9662 (b\u1ec7nh vi\u1ec7n l\u1edbn) \u2014 nhanh v\xe0 r\u1ebb h\u01a1n. \u0110\u1ebfn n\u01a1i vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u ti\xean l\xe0 \u639b\u865f (\u0111\u0103ng k\xfd). Ch\u01b0a c\xf3 th\u1ebb? G\u1ecdi 1955.","ALWAYS bring your health card \u2014 pay ~150-400 NTD with it, 3-5x more without. For minor illness go to a \u8a3a\u6240 (clinic), not a big hospital. First step is \u639b\u865f (register). No card yet? Call 1955.","\u0110\xe3 bi\u1ebft \u0111i kh\xe1m b\u1ec7nh","Hospital Survivor",B.a68,B.aaS,B.a14)
